flowchart TB
 Model[Model: proposes read action] --> Policy[Server: policy / strict args / budget]
 Policy --> Tools[Read-only scoped tools]
 Tools --> Evidence[Untrusted evidence data]
 Evidence --> Grounding[Allowed citation set / structured report]
 Grounding --> Proposal[Model: proposes Note / no write tool]
 Proposal --> Human[Human Review / Edit]
 Human --> Approval[Exact args / version / HMAC / user-workspace binding]
 Approval --> Lock[Server locked transaction / idempotency key]
 Lock --> Note[KnowledgeNote]
 Browser[Browser userId / workspaceId is not authority] --> Session[Server Session -> User -> Workspace]
 Session --> Policy
 Session --> Approval
